  "title": "Vendor Load-In Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Preserve the timeline and observed effects of a vendor movement incident, route immediate action, and track corrective ownership to close.",
  "description": "An original incident record for a load-in disruption, access conflict, property impact, missing item, or unsafe observed condition. It separates facts from assumptions, preserves evidence, records immediate response, escalation, linked records, corrective actions, and reviewed disposition.",
  "use_case": "Use when a vendor arrival or internal movement departs from the issued plan and causes or could cause injury, damage, loss, blocked access, schedule disruption, or another condition requiring responsible venue review.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
